            }
          ],
          "attrs": {
            "localId": "9f66b26f5538"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Brody Murray  [10:40 AM]"
            },
            {
              "type": "hardBreak"
            }
          ],
          "attrs": {
            "localId": "9392845b4428"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "@john.shea",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "https://collibra.slack.com/team/U02125CN9UH"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "hardBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I'm going to follow up with Anie to re-confirm permissions and that they've got the data architect persona locked down for participation in the trial of Raito."
            },
            {
              "type": "hardBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "From a PS standpoint are we good to go for your assistance with helping Anie and team with setup via the 12 hours PS time? If so and we're ready, I'll let Myriam know to send out the welcome email to them. Anie reached out to you to discuss the implementation for the trial FYI!"
            }
          ],
          "attrs": {
            "localId": "b56396c14cb9"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "@Sharon",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "https://collibra.slack.com/team/U08L2GPPVSN"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " FYI!"
            }
          ],
          "attrs": {
            "localId": "d763ee9bcfce"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Brody Murray  [12:19 PM]"
            },
            {
              "type": "hardBreak"
            }
          ],
          "attrs": {
            "localId": "c8acc03b8750"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Hey "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "@john.shea",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "https://collibra.slack.com/team/U02125CN9UH"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "!"
            }
          ],
          "attrs": {
            "localId": "6289cbbb8b2e"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "We haven't gotten to that stage yet, we've had an overview with them with "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "@Bart_VDK",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "https://collibra.slack.com/team/U52QQ4SHE"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "@alin.coop",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "https://collibra.slack.com/team/U08BU6DSQ8H"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " while I was on leave a few weeks ago. They don't have any success criteria well-defined, that they've shared with us, but I've extracted some out of Andrew D's comments from that session:"
            },
            {
              "type": "hardBreak"
            }
          ],
          "attrs": {
            "localId": "a3d740c3e07c"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "bulletList",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "attrs": {
                "localId": "c2351805db4a"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "They've had Azure Databricks up and running for 3 years"
                    }
                  ],
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "ca2d606d2d84"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "attrs": {
                "localId": "b6c3ce1a30da"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "All data access governed by AD - rudimentary data security model while building data products, and now Immuta"
                    }
                  ],
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "23675583a000"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "attrs": {
                "localId": "d70cd50c3f7f"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Immuta (currently on-prem) - renewal with Immuta is happening now - pushing for SW to move to SaaS offering."
                    }
                  ],
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "e204b7e35a14"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "bulletList",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "b71794a044ef"
                      },
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Risk-averse org, so infra/architects need to be convinced on their SaaS offering. Still a lot of hurdles to get through to make the move."
                            }
                          ],
                          "attrs": {
                            "localId": "68390968c153"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "8c334f9c6412"
                      },
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Collibra has been through a lot of this already with their architects, and has been in place for 6-7 years, so this is in our favour"
                            }
                          ],
                          "attrs": {
                            "localId": "bfb466b2218d"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ],
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "27c556ee236c"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "attrs": {
                "localId": "8b940138c35c"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Consolidation play - why have Immuta if already have Collibra and Raito can replicate what they're doing today in Immuta?"
                    }
                  ],
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "e4088983661e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "attrs": {
                "localId": "6b3e525ca836"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Collibra is front-end for all data governance, DQ, access, at the moment - most users see front-end as Collibra, so desire to have other aspects such as access governed here too."
                    }
                  ],
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "33bb33f7de8c"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "attrs": {
                "localId": "3481e5eca815"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Success criteria"
                    }
                  ],
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "530f361479bf"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "bulletList",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "ca8c69fa9ac8"
                      },
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Well-defined success criteria doesn't exist yet, but aligns with Raito's use-cases (data access management, masking/filtering, access/usage monitoring dashboarding)"
                            }
                          ],
                          "attrs": {
                            "localId": "66c0b3a69156"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "9fe15bac7780"
                      },
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "A few things called out explicitly:"
                            }
                          ],
                          "attrs": {
                            "localId": "c5cc04624e73"
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "bulletList",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "listItem",
                              "attrs": {
                                "localId": "659a94ea64de"
                              },
                              "content": [
                                {
                                  "type": "paragraph",
                                  "content": [
                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "text": "PII - ",
                                      "marks": [
                                        {
                                          "type": "strong"
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "text": "Automated PII detection and classification"
                                    }
                                  ],
                                  "attrs": {
                                    "localId": "e1c29e575509"
                                  }
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "listItem",
                              "attrs": {
                                "localId": "e6ecebce0190"
                              },
                              "content": [
                                {
                                  "type": "paragraph",
                                  "content": [
                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "text": "Masking/filtering - ",
                                      "marks": [
                                        {
                                          "type": "strong"
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "text": "Automated record filtering and dynamic masking/anonymisation based on what user is permitted to access"
                                    }
                                  ],
                                  "attrs": {
                                    "localId": "8545c4c31b5b"
                                  }
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "listItem",
                              "attrs": {
                                "localId": "c92ecee790ee"
                              },
                              "content": [
                                {
                                  "type": "paragraph",
                                  "content": [
                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "text": "Fully integrated data intelligence platform - ",
                                      "marks": [
                                        {
                                          "type": "strong"
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "text": "Access should sit alongside stewardship governance, CDEs, rules, etc (one platform)."
                                    }
                                  ],
                                  "attrs": {
                                    "localId": "a61ef0447770"
                                  }
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "listItem",
                              "attrs": {
                                "localId": "7724c02bcb5c"
                              },
                              "content": [
                                {
                                  "type": "paragraph",
                                  "content": [
                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "text": "Agnostic - ",
                                      "marks": [
                                        {
                                          "type": "strong"
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "text": "Access governance shouldn't just be tied to a single enterprise data platform - and should go beyond just Azure Databricks"
                                    }
                                  ],
                                  "attrs": {
                                    "localId": "66560ebd0bfa"
                                  }
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "listItem",
                              "attrs": {
                                "localId": "bec378c22bf8"
                              },
                              "content": [
                                {
                                  "type": "paragraph",
                                  "content": [
                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "text": "Auditable and centralised management - ",
                                      "marks": [
                                        {
                                          "type": "strong"
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "text": "Access should be centrally auditable and governed (currently Immuta Data Lab sandboxes are unregulated)."
                                    }
                                  ],
                                  "attrs": {
                                    "localId": "924add24b02d"
                                  }
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ],
                          "attrs": {
                            "localId": "e5b185bfef41"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ],
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "683e2d1e3eb9"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "attrs": {
            "localId": "b40c181c3043"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
            "localId": "0a81c32fbeaf"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
            "localId": "a488e46be5f7"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "We can build these out as we progress, but Andrew D is on leave this week just FYI"
            }
          ],
          "attrs": {
            "localId": "64371453437c"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
